WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.795
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: A tortoise cheats its

00:00:04.795 --> 00:00:07.859
friends and loses their trust. What might the moral be?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.244
The answer is: Honesty matters. A fable teaches lessons through events.

00:00:14.117 --> 00:00:19.317
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which feature is common in

00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:19.642
fables?

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.997
The answer is: Animals acting as characters. Fables often use animals that represent

00:00:25.997 --> 00:00:26.850
human behaviours.
